    "30 天从首次打开起计算，领取或恢复凭证不会重新开始试用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 天从首次打开起计算，领取或恢复凭证不会重新开始试用。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your 30 days begin when you first open the app. Claiming or restoring a receipt does not restart the trial."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 天從首次打開起計算，領取或恢復憑證不會重新開始試用。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30日間はアプリを初めて開いた日から始まります。レシートの受け取りや復元でお試し期間がやり直されることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine 30 Tage beginnen beim ersten Öffnen der App. Beleg abholen oder wiederherstellen startet die Testphase nicht neu."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus 30 días empiezan la primera vez que abres la app. Obtener o restaurar un recibo no reinicia la prueba."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos 30 jours commencent à la première ouverture de l’app. Obtenir ou restaurer un reçu ne relance pas l’essai."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seus 30 dias começam na primeira vez que você abre o app. Pegar ou restaurar um recibo não reinicia o teste."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I tuoi 30 giorni iniziano alla prima apertura dell’app. Richiedere o ripristinare una ricevuta non fa ripartire la prova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AHA/ACC：正常 <120 且 <80；正常高值 120–129 且 <80；1 级 130–139 或 80–89；2 级 ≥140 或 ≥90；≥180 或 >120 需关注。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC：正常 <120 且 <80；正常高值 120–129 且 <80；1 级 130–139 或 80–89；2 级 ≥140 或 ≥90；≥180 或 >120 需关注。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC: Normal <120 and <80; Elevated 120–129 and <80; Stage 1 130–139 or 80–89; Stage 2 ≥140 or ≥90. Readings ≥180 or >120 need attention."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC：正常 <120 且 <80；正常高值 120–129 且 <80；1 級 130–139 或 80–89；2 級 ≥140 或 ≥90；≥180 或 >120 需關注。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC：正常 <120 かつ <80、上昇 120–129 かつ <80、ステージ1 130–139 または 80–89、ステージ2 ≥140 または ≥90。≥180 または >120 の値は注意が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC: Normal <120 und <80; Erhöht 120–129 und <80; Stufe 1 130–139 oder 80–89; Stufe 2 ≥140 oder ≥90. Werte ≥180 oder >120 brauchen Aufmerksamkeit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC: Normal <120 y <80; Elevada 120–129 y <80; Etapa 1 130–139 u 80–89; Etapa 2 ≥140 o ≥90. Lecturas ≥180 o >120 requieren atención."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC : Normale <120 et <80 ; Élevée 120–129 et <80 ; Stade 1 130–139 ou 80–89 ; Stade 2 ≥140 ou ≥90. Les mesures ≥180 ou >120 demandent de l’attention."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC: Normal <120 e <80; Elevada 120–129 e <80; Estágio 1 130–139 ou 80–89; Estágio 2 ≥140 ou ≥90. Leituras ≥180 ou >120 pedem atenção."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AHA/ACC: Normale <120 e <80; Elevata 120–129 e <80; Stadio 1 130–139 o 80–89; Stadio 2 ≥140 o ≥90. Valori ≥180 o >120 richiedono attenzione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
