    "请休息 5 分钟后再记一次；如果反复很高，或有胸痛、气短、剧烈头痛、说话不清等，请立即就医或拨打急救电话。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请休息 5 分钟后再记一次；如果反复很高，或有胸痛、气短、剧烈头痛、说话不清等，请立即就医或拨打急救电话。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest for 5 minutes and take another reading. If readings remain very high, or you have chest pain, shortness of breath, severe headache or trouble speaking, seek emergency care immediately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請休息 5 分鐘后再記一次；如果反復很高，或有胸痛、氣短、劇烈頭痛、說話不清等，請立即就醫或撥打急救電話。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5分間安静にしてからもう一度測ってください。非常に高い値が続く場合や、胸の痛み、息切れ、激しい頭痛、話しにくさがある場合は、すぐに救急を受診してください。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ruh dich 5 Minuten aus und miss erneut. Bleiben die Werte sehr hoch oder hast du Brustschmerzen, Atemnot, starke Kopfschmerzen oder Sprachstörungen, such sofort den Notdienst auf."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Descansa 5 minutos y vuelve a medir. Si las lecturas siguen muy altas, o tienes dolor en el pecho, falta de aire, dolor de cabeza intenso o dificultad para hablar, busca atención de urgencia de inmediato."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reposez-vous 5 minutes et mesurez à nouveau. Si les valeurs restent très élevées, ou en cas de douleur thoracique, d’essoufflement, de mal de tête intense ou de difficulté à parler, consultez les urgences immédiatement."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Descanse 5 minutos e meça de novo. Se as leituras continuarem muito altas, ou se tiver dor no peito, falta de ar, dor de cabeça forte ou dificuldade para falar, procure atendimento de emergência imediatamente."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Riposa 5 minuti e misura di nuovo. Se i valori restano molto alti o hai dolore al petto, fiato corto, forte mal di testa o difficoltà a parlare, chiama subito i soccorsi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "购买未完成，请检查网络后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
