    "还没有记录，从下面的大按钮开始。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有记录，从下面的大按钮开始。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No readings yet. Use the large button below to begin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有記錄，從下面的大按鈕開始。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ記録がありません。下の大きなボタンから始めましょう。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Werte. Starte mit der großen Taste unten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay lecturas. Usa el botón grande de abajo para empezar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune mesure pour l’instant. Commencez avec le grand bouton ci-dessous."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nenhuma leitura ainda. Use o botão grande abaixo para começar."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ancora nessuna misurazione. Usa il pulsante grande qui sotto per iniziare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这 30 天您记了 %@ 次血压。买断后可用 PDF 报表、长期趋势、小组件、新增家人和提醒。记录本身永远免费。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这 30 天您记了 %@ 次血压。买断后可用 PDF 报表、长期趋势、小组件、新增家人和提醒。记录本身永远免费。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You recorded blood pressure %@ times in these 30 days. A one-time purchase unlocks PDF reports, long-term trends, widgets, and new family profiles and reminders. Recording stays free forever."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這 30 天您記了 %@ 次血壓。買斷后可用 PDF 報表、長期趨勢、小組件、新增家人和提醒。記錄本身永遠免費。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この30日間で血圧を%@回記録しました。買い切りでPDFレポート、長期の推移、ウィジェット、家族のプロフィールと通知の追加が使えます。記録はずっと無料です。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast in diesen 30 Tagen %@-mal Blutdruck eingetragen. Ein Einmalkauf schaltet PDF-Berichte, Langzeitverlauf, Widgets sowie neue Familienprofile und Erinnerungen frei. Eintragen bleibt für immer kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registraste la presión arterial %@ veces en estos 30 días. Un pago único desbloquea informes PDF, tendencias a largo plazo, widgets y nuevos perfiles familiares y recordatorios. Registrar es gratis para siempre."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez relevé votre tension %@ fois en 30 jours. Un achat unique débloque les rapports PDF, les tendances à long terme, les widgets et les nouveaux profils familiaux et rappels. Le relevé reste gratuit pour toujours."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você registrou a pressão %@ vezes nestes 30 dias. Uma compra única libera relatórios PDF, tendências de longo prazo, widgets e novos perfis familiares e lembretes. Registrar é grátis para sempre."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In questi 30 giorni hai registrato la pressione %@ volte. Un acquisto unico sblocca report PDF, andamento a lungo termine, widget e nuovi profili e promemoria. Registrare resta sempre gratis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个数对吗？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
